      <h1 id="update-completing-the-z-stream-update" class="group scroll-mt-20">Completing the z-stream cluster update<a href="#update-completing-the-z-stream-update" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
