      <h2 id="update-updating-the-worker-nodes_completing-the-z-stream-update" class="group scroll-mt-20">Updating the worker nodes<a href="#update-updating-the-worker-nodes_completing-the-z-stream-update" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
