      <h2 id="update-verifying-the-health-of-the-newly-updated-cluster_completing-the-z-stream-update" class="group scroll-mt-20">Verifying the health of the newly updated cluster<a href="#update-verifying-the-health-of-the-newly-updated-cluster_completing-the-z-stream-update" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
